sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant UI as Chat page
  participant F as /api/chat
  participant O as Orchestrator (src/core)
  participant D as Bundled JSON
  participant L as LLM provider
  participant B as Netlify Blobs

  C->>UI: "When is my next payment?"
  UI->>F: POST conversationId + message
  F->>B: load conversation (strong consistency)
  F->>O: handle turn
  O->>O: handed over? rule-based handover triggers?
  O->>L: classify intent (verification details stripped)
  L-->>O: account question
  O-->>F: state VERIFYING — text + verify_form
  F->>B: save conversation + audit record
  F-->>UI: messages

  C->>UI: submits mobile number + last 4 of ID
  UI->>F: POST action=verify (never sent to the LLM)
  F->>O: verify
  O->>D: match normalised phone + id_last4 in loans.json
  alt match
    O->>D: borrower's loans + matched allocations
    O-->>F: state VERIFIED — account_card (figures from data) + text
  else third failure
    O->>B: create handover (reason, transcript, details)
    O-->>F: state HANDED_OVER — handover_notice (agent hours aware)
  end
  F->>B: save conversation + audit record (inputs masked)
  F-->>UI: messages
  Note over UI,B: While HANDED_OVER or WITH_AGENT the bot is silent and timers are paused.
  participant S as Staff page (agent)
  S->>B: claim (agent name) — state WITH_AGENT
  loop every 3 s while handed over
    UI->>F: GET /api/conversation/:id?after=lastId
    F-->>UI: new agent messages
  end
  S->>B: reply (stored as its own message key)
  S->>B: return to assistant — state VERIFIED or ANONYMOUS, timers restart
  UI->>F: poll sees "back with the assistant", polling stops
